            "id": "https://sharenjun.github.io/2024ning-bo-sai-xian-xia-sai-awd.html",
            "url": "https://sharenjun.github.io/2024ning-bo-sai-xian-xia-sai-awd.html",
            "title": "2024宁波赛线下赛AWD",
            "content_html": "<h1 id=\"全场都上waf没得玩。web手纯坐牢\">全场都上waf没得玩。web手纯坐牢</h1>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/Snipaste_2024-05-25_12-39-40-2.jpg\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1405\" height=\"708\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/Snipaste_2024-05-25_12-39-40-2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/Snipaste_2024-05-25_12-39-40-2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/Snipaste_2024-05-25_12-39-40-2-md.jpg 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/Snipaste_2024-05-25_12-39-40-2-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/Snipaste_2024-05-25_12-39-40-2-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/Snipaste_2024-05-25_12-39-40-2-2xl.jpg 1600w\"></figure><h1 id=\"任意文件下载\">任意文件下载</h1>\n<p><figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1125\" height=\"703\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure>\ndownload函数中input没有任何过滤。可以这就造成了任意文件下载的漏洞\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image2.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1377\" height=\"235\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure>\n这样就能下载到文件</p><h2 id=\"fix\">fix</h2>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image-2.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1125\" height=\"703\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-2-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-2-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-2-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-2-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-2-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-2-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure><pre><code>    public function download()\n    {\n        $input = input();\n        $arry=[&#39;../&#39;,&#39;flag&#39;,&#39;.&#39;,&#39;..&#39;,&#39;/&#39;,&#39; &#39;,&#39;php&#39;];\n        foreach ($arry as $unsafe){\n            if(strpos($input[&#39;url&#39;],$unsafe)){\n                echo &quot;nonono&quot;;\n                return ;\n            }//首字符串出现的位置\n        }\n        return download(public_path() . $input[&#39;url&#39;], $input[&#39;title&#39;]);\n    }\n</code></pre>\n<h1 id=\"命令执行-预留\">命令执行-预留</h1>\n<p>位于public\\themes\\template\\404.html\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image-3.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1125\" height=\"703\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-3-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-3-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-3-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-3-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-3-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-3-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure>\n触发条件就是直接访问一个不存在的php文件。例如/none.php,他会将404.html给包含进来，包含进来了就相当于把这段代码包含进来。从而实现rce或者一些命令执行的操作\n这里可以用error类或者exception类来实现\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image-4.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1125\" height=\"703\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-4-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-4-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-4-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-4-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-4-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-4-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure></p><h2 id=\"error类介绍\">Error类介绍</h2>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/error.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1443\" height=\"641\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/error-a.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"845\" height=\"586\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-a-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-a-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-a-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-a-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-a-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/error-a-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure><h2 id=\"exception类介绍\">Exception类介绍</h2>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/ex2.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"929\" height=\"598\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure><figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/ex2.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"929\" height=\"598\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/ex2-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure><h1 id=\"任意文件上传\">任意文件上传</h1>\n<p>漏洞点在Controller/File.php中,利用是需要进入admin后台才可以利用的。利用点在头像上传那。\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image-5.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1125\" height=\"677\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-5-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-5-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-5-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-5-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-5-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-5-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image2-2.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1125\" height=\"630\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-2-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-2-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-2-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-2-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-2-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image2-2-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure></p><h2 id=\"fix-1\">fix</h2>\n<pre><code>        $extcheck=strtolower($uploadFile-&gt;getExtension());#把传进来都变成小写\n        $allowext=[&#39;png&#39;,&#39;jpg&#39;,&#39;jpeg&#39;,&#39;gif&#39;];#直接白名单就好了\n        if(!in_array($extcheck,$allowext)){\n            throw new ErrorException(&quot;you can&#39;t upload other extion file&quot;);\n        }\n</code></pre>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/image-6.png\" alt=\"Image description\" width=\"1125\" height=\"703\"  sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-6-xs.png 300w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-6-sm.png 480w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-6-md.png 768w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-6-lg.png 1024w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-6-xl.png 1360w ,https://sharenjun.github.io/media/posts/5/responsive/image-6-2xl.png 1600w\"></figure>",
